rParametrizeRNC -- Compute a rational parametrization of a rational normal curve.
*********************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        rParametrizeRNC(I)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, of a rational normal curve.
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, of a matrix phi and an ideal Ic.

Description
===========

Compute a rational parametrization of a rational normal curve C defined by I.

phi contains the rational parametrization of C over \mathbb{P}^{1} if the
degree of C is odd or over a conic if the degree of C is even.

Ic is the 0-ideal for odd degree or the ideal of the conic for even degree.



