|i1 : K=QQ;                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : R=K[v,u,z];                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : I0=ideal(v^8-u^3*(z+u)^5);                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : J=ideal matrix {{u^6+4*u^5*z+6*u^4*z^2+4*u^3*z^3+u^2*z^4,v*u^5+3*v*u^4*z|
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Ideal of R                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|+3*v*u^3*z^2+v*u^2*z^3,v^2*u^4+3*v^2*u^3*z+3*v^2*u^2*z^2+v^2*u*z^3,v^3*u^3+2*|
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|v^3*u^2*z+v^3*u*z^2,v^4*u^2+v^4*u*z,v^5*u+v^5*z,v^6}};                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : I=mapToRNC(I0,J)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = ideal (x x  - x x , x x  - x x , x x  - x x , x x  - x x , x x  - x x , |
|             4 5    3 6   3 5    2 6   1 5    0 6   3 4    1 6   2 4    0 6  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|             2   2                              2                            |
|     x x  - x , x  - x x , x x  - x x , x x  - x , x x  - x x , x x  - x x , |
|      0 4    6   3    0 6   2 3    0 5   1 3    6   0 3    5 6   1 2    5 6  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|             2   2                       2                                   |
|     x x  - x , x  - x x , x x  - x x , x  - x x )                           |
|      0 2    5   1    4 6   0 1    3 6   0    2 6                            |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : Ideal of QQ[x , x , x , x , x , x , x ]                                 |
|                  0   1   2   3   4   5   6                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : rParametrizeRNC(I)                                                      |
|                                                                             |
|                             2                                               |
|o6 = {| t_0^2t_2   |, ideal(t  - t t )}                                      |
